{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）早上6時49分，警方接報一名女子昏迷在旺角廣東道一幢唐樓的梯間。救援人員到場將該名40餘歲女子送往廣華醫院搶救，但延至上午7時33分不</p><p>現場是廣東道1074號2樓。現場消息指，梯間遺下一件衫、一隻拖鞋和一支針筒，有警員在場看守。警方暫列有人暈倒案，正於附近店舖翻查閉路電視調查案件。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129363648444108800392648.jpeg/Jh3N7SdzT-sOarD1dQvYX95ZnOKAaqJbGJhWKDKYVig\" alt=\"現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129363646426648576206983.jpeg/oJyPuzP1hrwUGvZ_Lj7KEstU4EoMcfzP7iDH7sQgx-4\" alt=\"現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129364301811814400789254.jpeg/Seg0L4-syCXc4tqiX4DiRvXACAx-Cqe68_Bky9nwZMs\" alt=\"梯間遺下一隻拖鞋。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>梯間遺下一隻拖鞋。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129364109868011520589632.jpeg/uWlhL1CgCzVJuRTQGRl2iP5mtHNMgznLaMFx4ULBceE\" alt=\"梯間遺下一隻拖鞋。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>梯間遺下一隻拖鞋。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129367763693867008692503.jpeg/CLSrBMRzHm1AKb-HDo8r_PwhJjc_1CzWMizeaBgs3mg\" alt=\"警員在梯間調查。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>警員在梯間調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129364106692792320367241.jpeg/Fd2UwvJ4HE-YfZZiDi54GXc3a7TBG50O5MeOws7HjsI\" alt=\"警員在場看守。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>警員在場看守。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129348514644889600485679.jpeg/Sll-_Jl0uEJcRRnp_WRY4jpqBJEI-kslC7JR3AuyUdw\" alt=\"現場遺下一件衫。\"><figcaption>現場遺下一件衫。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129363661052710912041736.jpeg/QPiw3tUosxbxDu04l03wiB4Yu9HUKXKg9lAlFdxQJRU\" alt=\"現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T02:43:29.796676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}